 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Brewmaster of the Martial World"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "斗曲天下 签约"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Six hundred years ago, under the Wu Dynasty, martial arts thrived. And among warriors, one saying was passed down through generations: “Anyone can become a martial artist—\nbut only the truly gifted can become a Brewmaster.” In a world where strength is forged in spirit and power flows through elemental energy, Ye Ling, a young man with an extraordinary sensitivity to the spiritual essence of heaven and earth, sets out on an unorthodox path: Not as a fighter, but as a cultivation brewmaster—a master of brewing spirit elixirs that can change destinies. Amid rival clans, ancient secrets, and power-hungry warriors, Ye Ling’s path will challenge what it means to be strong—and prove that in a world ruled by fists, the true alchemy of power lies in what you create."
  },
